  "message656": "Early efficiency applies through year {earlyEndYear1}. The separately authored later ratio begins in year {earlyEndYear2} and holds through year {fadeStartYear3}. Capital intensity then fades to terminal-consistent efficiency by year {terminalYear4}. Growth and margin keep their own calendars.",
